to the front: 164 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 11, Long Heath" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A long fairway through flowering coastal heath rolling toward the ocean" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-heath.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->11</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->4</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">11</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Long Heath</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->5<!-- --> · <!-- -->568<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">The longest hole on the estate crosses open heathland in flower from March to June. Three disciplined shots, a patient putter, and the ocean in view the whole way.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Heath in flower: March to June</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 16, Mirror" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A peninsula green on a still reservoir at dawn, its flag reflected in the water" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-mirror.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->16</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->16</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">16</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Mirror</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->3<!-- --> · <!-- -->164<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">A peninsula green reaching into the reservoir with water on three sides. On still mornings the flag appears twice, once in the air and once in the water.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Green depth: 28 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 18, The Return" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="The final green below a low rammed earth clubhouse with a long timber roof, glowing at dusk" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-return.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->18</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->6</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">18</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">The Return</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->4<!-- --> · <!-- -->461<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">Uphill toward the clubhouse, where the terrace watches every approach. A generous fairway and a fiercely contoured green make it a hole of nerve.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Climbs 21 m to the green</p></div></article><div class="flex w-[70vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col justify-end gap-6 sm:w-[40vw] lg:w-[24vw] lg:pb-4"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.8rem,2.6vw,2.6rem)] leading-[1.1] text-bone/90">Thirteen more, and not one of them filler.</p><a class="inline-flex h-12 w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal" href="#course-map">See the full routing<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="mx-5 mb-10 h-px bg-bone/15 sm:mx-8 lg:mx-12 lg:mb-10"><span class="block h-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-ochre"></span></div></div></section>
